<title>UK: SOCCER-WALES BEAT SAN MARINO 4-0 IN UNDER-21 MATCH.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-WALES BEAT SAN MARINO 4-0 IN UNDER-21 MATCH.</headline>
<dateline>BARRY, Wales 1996-08-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Wales beat San Marino 4-0 (halftime 2-0) in a European under-21 soccer match on Friday.</p>
<p>Scorers:</p>
<p>Wales - John Hartson (12th, 56th and 83rd minutes), Scott Young (24th)</p>
<p>Attendance: 1,800</p>
